{"detail": {"templateUuid": "f1770f0682a94c49863e707d48a014d3", "projectUuid": "633b40134a934ccfb91e4a6dd89ddb5e", "name": "《归途与光芒》致敬每一位平凡而伟大的建设者！", "description": "你有多久没回家了？\n“爸爸，隔壁小玉的爸爸天天下班带她玩，你什么时候回来呀？”\n这或许是每一个留守孩子心里，最想问的一句话。\n年复一年，他们过完春节就收拾行囊离家，把对小家的牵挂留在身后，去凿通大山的路，去架起悬崖的桥。 他们用粗糙的双手与闪光的青春，架起了一座座大桥，铺就了一条条通途。\n而这一切的付出，都是为了能带着千千万万的人，早点平平安安地回家—— 也为了能在除夕前夕，准时推开家门，拥抱最爱的孩子。\n❤️ 他们把青春留在天地间，只为给千家万户，铺就最平坦的归途。\n致敬每一位平凡而伟大的中国建设者！", "coverUrl": "/assets/3d3ce5bf506f3005.webp", "finalOutput": "https://libtv-res.liblib.art/upload-images/ea845bc2267c4c1aa6df5099a6da594c/1e58985e806ce1216978b3f8d8c24cbf799d670b.mp4", "snapshotId": 35571, "auditStatus": 1, "ownerId": 3990772, "ownerUuid": "ea845bc2267c4c1aa6df5099a6da594c", "avatar": "/assets/9efbeeb0f2cc394c.webp", "nickname": "Dave", "isLike": false, "likeCount": 108, "tags": [{"id": 1201, "code": "short_series", "tagLabel": "短片剧集", "parentTag": 1200, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1200/1201/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1108, "code": "public_welfare", "tagLabel": "公益广告", "parentTag": 1100, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1100/1108/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 8, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}, {"id": 1000, "code": "selected", "tagLabel": "精选画布", "parentTag": 0, "categoryId": 0, "path": "1000/", "tagStatus": 1, "tagOrder": 1, "tagIcon": "", "children": null, "tagType": 1}], "userTags": [{"tagId": 5002, "name": "专业", "icon": "/assets/a31a6cc391430f72.webp", "primaryIcon": "/assets/7097b07d2df12cc8.webp", "desc": "LibTV专业作者", "verifyLevel": 2}], "score": 0, "socialMediaUrl": "https://www.douyin.com/user/self?from_tab_name=main&modal_id=7672355970793639211&showTab=post", "createAt": "2026年08月10日 19:10", "updateAt": "2026年08月12日 11:10", "publishAt": "2026年08月10日 19:10", "playCount": 558, "viewCreationProcessCount": 287, "copyCanvasCount": 58, "shareCount": 15, "snapshotPath": "/data/canvas-snapshots/f1770f0682a94c49863e707d48a014d3.json.gz", "snapshotSummary": {"node